  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole animal, short rounded snout and broad flexible paddlelike forelimbs. Not a dolphin-shaped later ichthyosaur or isolated fossil slab. [\"Only one severely compressed skeleton; missing distal tail and soft tissue inferred.\", \"Paddle outlines, colour, skin and exact distal tail proportions artistic. Flexible wrist function is interpretation supported by anatomy, not filmed behavior.\", \"2020 finding replaces older toothless interpretation: posterior rounded crushing teeth are concealed in side view; closed mouth need not model hidden dental rows.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 0.4, \"basis\": \"Gutarra 2019 supplement table lists 0.4m estimate from Motani2015; tail incomplete, not total measured fossil length. UC Davis2014 roughly1.5feet is rounded outreach scale.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole animal, short rounded snout and broad flexible paddlelike forelimbs. Not a dolphin-shaped later ichthyosaur or isolated fossil slab. [\"Only one severely compressed skeleton; missing distal tail and soft tissue inferred.\", \"Paddle outlines, colour, skin and exact distal tail proportions artistic. Flexible wrist function is interpretation supported by anatomy, not filmed behavior.\", \"2020 finding replaces older toothless interpretation: posterior rounded crushing teeth are concealed in side view; closed mouth need not model hidden dental rows.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 0.4, \"basis\": \"Gutarra 2019 supplement table lists 0.4m estimate from Motani2015; tail incomplete, not total measured fossil length. UC Davis2014 roughly1.5feet is rounded outreach scale.\"}"
  },
